Kronicle, you are finally awake.
Koschev the Immortal has defied the Divine.
Mortals have severed their threads of fate. Humanity has tasted freedom.
This cannot be undone.
Yet still, your powers linger.
Their choices are theirs alone.
But <i>when</i> they act...
That remains yours to shape.
